<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>RUNRUNRUN - Sped Up Version</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Dutch Melrose</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dutch Melrose (Sped Up Versions), Pt. 1</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">31YBG6czIKazcM4j9WBlIW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">2 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">RUNRUNRUN (Sped Up Version) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, father, please, please forgive all my sins</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The water is way too deep, the deep end is where I live</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Father, please, there's blood all over these sheets</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The devil is in the mirror, he's staring right over me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I always thought it would be easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To get you out my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I think I found a new addiction</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And it feels so right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run, run for your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'ma tear out your heart, it'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run, run for your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gonna tear out your heart, it'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, therе she go, losing my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll love mе to death 'cause I will</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, there she go, show me you care</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll always be there 'cause I will</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, father, please, please don't waste anytime</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The sirens are turning red, I found a whole 'nother vice</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Father, please, she's perfect in your design</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She's covered in Saint Laurent, you've shown me the holy light[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I always thought it would be easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To get you out my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I think I found a new addiction</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And it feels so right</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run, run for your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'ma tear out your heart, it'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run, run for your life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Gonna tear out your heart, it'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Post-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, there she go, losing my head</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll love me to death 'cause I will</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, there she go, show me you care</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Say you'll always be there 'cause I will</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run, baby, run</p></div></body></tt>